 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Pain Killer — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>While you cannot heal, you can stop injuries from getting worse.</p></blockquote><p>Starting at 1st level, you can use your technique to stop injuries from getting worse. As a bonus action for 1 CE, you can make a symbol with your hand and touch a creature within 5 feet. If a creature is taking damage over time, you cause that damage to stop and the creature gains temporary hit points equal to your CE modifier + your level for 1 hour. This does not stop new effects from affecting the target. You also gain proficiency in Medicine.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
